31:30.290 --> 31:31.810
Where is the big one?

31:34.900 --> 31:36.560
There are signs of a struggle,

31:36.850 --> 31:38.980
and more than one person was involved.

31:39.220 --> 31:41.880
What did they struggle with?

31:45.090 --> 31:46.740
It looks like a snake.

31:46.920 --> 31:47.400
Wait,

31:47.880 --> 31:48.440
